_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage:</strong> Fail, retry, and fail again\u2014until you achieve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Replayable Fun</strong></i><strong>:</strong> Push for a smooth run and a faster time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Environment:</strong> It is actually difficult.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/3624c238026fb29674ea9a2c4ddff810.poster.avif?t=1743438961\" width=528 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/3624c238026fb29674ea9a2c4ddff810.webm?t=1743438961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/3624c238026fb29674ea9a2c4ddff810.mp4?t=1743438961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the rope and see how far you can go!</p>",
